      "title": "Noise of the Cyber Sakura, Echoes of the Memory Market",
      "premise": "Acid rain never stops. In neon‑drenched back‑alleys where the lights seem to melt, I work as a broker who buys and sells memories at rock‑bottom prices. One day, a client brings me a memory of the “Pure White Sakura”—a legend the ruling corporation supposedly erased after it once ruled the city. Hidden within that data is a virus capable of overturning the city’s entire system. Dodging relentless pursuit drones, I dive deeper into the truth behind the information."
    },
